{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_120_realnvp-title\">RealNVP</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">RealNVP 以三角 Jacobian 的 affine coupling 获得同时精确可逆、可采样且可算 log-likelihood 的映射。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Constructs an exactly invertible normalizing flow using stacked affine coupling layers whose triangular Jacobians permit O(D) log-determinant and exact likelihood evaluation.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">连续化图像 x</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Continuous-valued image or feature vector x</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">潜变量 z、精确 log-likelihood，或由 z 反演生成的图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Latent variable z = f(x), exact log-density log p_X(x), or exact inverse sample x = f^{-1}(z)</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figures 2 and 4 · PDF pp.4, 6</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=HkpbnH9lx\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_120_realnvp')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_120_realnvp')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"RealNVP original paper architecture figure, Figures 2 and 4\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/58d8870ac7529f6e0912.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figures 2 and 4 · PDF pp.4, 6</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_120_realnvp', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_120_realnvp\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_120_realnvp')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_120_realnvp', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_120_realnvp\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">数据 x</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">训练样本经尺度变换/连续化后输入</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests continuous-valued image or feature vector x and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"训练样本经尺度变换/连续化后输入\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests continuous-valued image or feature vector x and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"数据 x\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 01\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_120_realnvp', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">数据 x</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 01</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">训练样本经尺度变换/连续化后输入</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests continuous-valued image or feature vector x and prepares initial tensor representations (Stage 01).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把变量拆成 xa 与 xb\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes channel to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"通道/棋盘划分\" data-node-name-en=\"channel\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_120_realnvp', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">通道/棋盘划分</span><span class=\"lang-en\">channel</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把变量拆成 xa 与 xb</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes channel to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"以 xa 经任意非可逆子网预测缩放和平移\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs s,t conditioner within the core affine coupling exact likelihood flow computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"s,t conditioner\" data-node-name-en=\"s,t conditioner\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_120_realnvp', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>s,t conditioner</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">以 xa 经任意非可逆子网预测缩放和平移</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs s,t conditioner within the core affine coupling exact likelihood flow computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"ya=xa；yb=xb·exp(s(xa))+t(xa)，可显式求逆\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Affine coupling within the core affine coupling exact likelihood flow computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Affine coupling\" data-node-name-en=\"Affine coupling\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_120_realnvp', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Affine coupling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">ya=xa；yb=xb·exp(s(xa))+t(xa)，可显式求逆</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Affine coupling within the core affine coupling exact likelihood flow computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"让后续 coupling 更新此前未变换的变量\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs mask within the core affine coupling exact likelihood flow computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"交替 mask/置换\" data-node-name-en=\"mask\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_120_realnvp', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">交替 mask/置换</span><span class=\"lang-en\">mask</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">让后续 coupling 更新此前未变换的变量</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs mask within the core affine coupling exact likelihood flow computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"逐尺度分出部分 latent，降低后续计算\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Squeeze multi-scale split within the core affine coupling exact likelihood flow computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Squeeze 与 multi-scale split\" data-node-name-en=\"Squeeze multi-scale split\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_120_realnvp', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">Squeeze 与 multi-scale split</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Squeeze multi-scale split</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">逐尺度分出部分 latent，降低后续计算</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Squeeze multi-scale split within the core affine coupling exact likelihood flow computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"log|det J| 为 s 的逐元素和，可精确计算似然\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Jacobian log-det to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"三角 Jacobian log-det\" data-node-name-en=\"Jacobian log-det\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_120_realnvp', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">三角 Jacobian log-det</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Jacobian log-det</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">log|det J| 为 s 的逐元素和，可精确计算似然</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Jacobian log-det to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"匹配简单先验并可沿逆 coupling 生成\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces latent variable z = f(x), exact log-density log p_x(x), or exact inverse sample x = f^{-1}(z) via latent variable z.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"潜变量 z / 逆向样本\" data-node-name-en=\"latent variable z\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_120_realnvp', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">潜变量 z / 逆向样本</span><span class=\"lang-en\">latent variable z</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">匹配简单先验并可沿逆 coupling 生成</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces latent variable z = f(x), exact log-density log p_x(x), or exact inverse sample x = f^{-1}(z) via latent variable z.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"RealNVP Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 仿射耦合层的可逆变换与精确似然</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Bijective Affine Coupling Layer &amp; Change-of-Variables Exact Log-Likelihood</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"RealNVP：核心公式 · 仿射耦合层的可逆变换与精确似然\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"120\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"23.038583pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.850917 -69.011212 302.145223 23.038583\" width=\"302.145223pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M3.672405-.962766L3.5533-1.081871C2.83867-.496271 2.530982-.337464 2.094264-.337464C1.53844-.337464 1.1712-.694779 1.1712-1.240677C1.1712-1.389559 1.19105-1.528515 1.270454-1.846128L1.548365-1.88583C3.037178-2.094264 4.089273-2.848595 4.089273-3.702182C4.089273-4.119049 3.79151-4.37711 3.295239-4.37711C1.865979-4.37711 .307688-2.749